[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0001","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-20230","title":"Perl Storable 模块堆栈溢出漏洞","description":"Perl 的 Storable 模块 3.05 之前版本中存在栈溢出漏洞，位于 retrieve_hook 函数处理类名长度时。该函数将类名长度存储为有符号整数，但在读取操作中将其作为无符号整数处理，导致攻击者可通过构造特制的序列化数据触发栈溢出。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响所有使用受影响 Storable 模块的 Perl 应用，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2017-20230"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-04-21T16:16:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:15:27Z","remediation":"立即升级 Perl Storable 模块至 3.05 或以上版本，可通过 CPAN 执行 `cpan -i Storable` 更新。如无法立即升级，避免使用 Storable 反序列化不可信来源数据，并限制应用程序对不受信任二进制数据的解包操作。补丁已合入 Perl 5 主干分支，提交 ID 为 a258c17c6937f79529c8319a829310e09cdbd216。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Perl/perl5/commit/a258c17c6937f79529c8319a829310e09cdbd216.patch","https://github.com/Perl/perl5/issues/15831","https://metacpan.org/release/RURBAN/Storable-3.05/changes","https://www.nntp.perl.org/group/perl.perl5.porters/2017/01/msg242533.html","https://www.nntp.perl.org/group/perl.perl5.porters/2017/01/msg242703.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/21/5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2017/20xxx/CVE-2017-20230.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3f14a770d93b602b06aecf87f2033bd6818a62d/osv/cve/2017/UBUNTU-CVE-2017-20230.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-04-21/TIER_3_CVE-2017-20230.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2017-20230","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/593bdbc51deef90595839eb5f1cfcb624c57384b/2017/20xxx/CVE-2017-20230.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/1f0131172164da5118cebcfe86d95fcf67ebc271/content/posts/cve-2017-20230.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2017-20230.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2017-20230-2026-05-02-0005","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-6r7m-2wh8-438w/GHSA-6r7m-2wh8-438w.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/4e0329739775d4c7a2559f4f72992787e49b59f3/references/contrib1-CVE-2017-20230-2026-05-01-0305"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0105","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-20194","title":"WordPress Formidable Form Builder 插件敏感数据泄露漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Formidable Form Builder 插件 2.05.03 及之前版本中存在敏感数据泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于插件通过 `frm_forms_preview` AJAX 接口未对请求进行充分的权限验证，导致未认证的远程攻击者无需任何身份凭证即可通过发送特制的 AJAX 请求，导出指定表单中的所有提交数据，包括用户填写的敏感信息。攻击者只需知道目标表单 ID 即可利用该漏洞，攻击门槛低。CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。建议用户升级插件至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2017-20194"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2024-10-16T08:15:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:15:22Z","remediation":"立即将 Formidable Form Builder 插件升级至 2.05.04 或更高版本。在 WordPress 后台进入\"插件\"页面，找到 Formidable Forms，点击\"更新\"按钮。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 frm_forms_preview AJAX 接口，在 functions.php 中添加 `add_filter('frm_forms_preview', '__return_false');` 或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则阻止对 `/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?action=frm_forms_preview` 的未认证访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://klikki.fi/formidable-forms-vulnerabilities/","https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/c7600fe1-94e4-4e3e-a9a6-ff3589813715?source=cve","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-20194.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-20194.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2017/CVE-2017-20194.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-20194.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/20xxx/CVE-2017-20194.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2017/20xxx/CVE-2017-20194.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/SSVC/data/2017/CVE-2017-20194.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-20194.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2017/CVE-2017-20194.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-20194-formidable-c7600fe1-94e4-4e3e-a9a6-ff3589813715.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-20194.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0105.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0105.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0104","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-20192","title":"WordPress Formidable Form Builder插件 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Formidable Form Builder 插件（版本低于 2.05.03）存在存储型跨站脚本漏洞，源于对表单提交中 `after_html` 等多个参数缺乏充分的输入清理与输出转义。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞注入任意 Web 脚本，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时脚本自动执行，导致敏感信息窃取、会话劫持或恶意操作。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 8.3，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2017-20192"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2024-10-16T07:15:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:15:22Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress Formidable Forms 插件更新至 2.05.03 或更高版本。在 WordPress 管理后台的插件页面点击「更新」即可自动升级。如无法立即更新，可临时禁用该插件作为缓解措施。该版本修复了表单预览功能中 after_html/before_html 参数导致的存储型 XSS 以及 display-frm-data 短代码中的 SQL 注入漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://klikki.fi/adv/formidable.html","https://wordpress.org/plugins/formidable/#developers","https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/900fcaab-2424-4ae8-af18-95659db0dbe3?source=cve","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-20192.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-20192.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2017/CVE-2017-20192.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2017/CVE-2017-20192.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-20192.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/20xxx/CVE-2017-20192.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2017/20xxx/CVE-2017-20192.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5fe4fb06582cbbd39c10cfbc884045e215a69cb5/2017/CVE-2017-20192.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/SSVC/data/2017/CVE-2017-20192.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-20192.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2017/CVE-2017-20192.json","https://github.com/flame-11/CVE-2017-20192-formidable-forms"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0104.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0104.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0103","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18638","title":"Graphite Graphite Web 服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Graphite 的 composer/views.py 中 send_email 函数存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该 SSRF 端点，使 Graphite Web 服务器向任意内部或外部资源发起 HTTP 请求，并将响应内容编码为图片文件后发送至攻击者指定的邮箱地址，从而实现敏感信息窃取。该漏洞影响 Graphite 1.1.5 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18638"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-11T23:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 Graphite-web 至 1.1.6 或更高版本。如无法升级，手动删除 webapp/graphite/composer/views.py 中的 send_email 函数，该函数未被使用且不影响正常功能。同时检查 SMTP 服务器配置，限制出站网络访问以缓解 SSRF 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.orange.tw/2017/07/how-i-chained-4-vulnerabilities-on.html#second-bug-internal-graphite-ssrf","https://github.com/graphite-project/graphite-web/issues/2008","https://github.com/graphite-project/graphite-web/pull/2499","https://github.com/graphite-project/graphite-web/security/advisories/GHSA-vfj6-275q-4pvm","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2019/10/msg00030.html","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ds4Gp4xoaeA","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18638.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18638.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18638.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2017-18638.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-18638-2999.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-18638-2998.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-18638-3000.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Graphite/CVE-2017-18638.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2017-18638.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18638.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18638.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0102","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18598","title":"WordPress Qards插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Qards 插件（版本至 2017-10-11）中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件在处理 html2canvasproxy.php 文件时，未对 url 参数中的远程文档内容进行充分过滤和转义，导致攻击者可以构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL 诱导用户点击。当用户访问特制链接后，恶意脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，造成敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或页面内容篡改等危害。攻击者无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接），影响范围包括所有使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18598"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-10T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:10Z","remediation":"该插件已从 WordPress 官方仓库下架且不再维护，无修复版本可用。建议立即删除 Qards 插件（在 WordPress 后台插件页面停用并删除 /wp-content/plugins/qards/ 目录）。如仍需类似功能，请替换为其他受支持的 WordPress 卡片/展示类插件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8934","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18598.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18598.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18598.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18598.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-18598-2997.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-18598-2996.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2017-18598.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18598.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18598.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-18598.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-18598/poc/nuclei/CVE-2017-18598.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0101","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18590","title":"WordPress Timesheet 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"tags.<value>WordPress Timesheet插件（由BestWebSoft开发）在0.1.5版本之前存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该插件未能对用户输入进行充分过滤和转义，导致攻击者可在页面中注入恶意JavaScript脚本。当管理员或其他用户访问受影响的页面时，注入的恶意脚本会在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露、会话Cookie劫持或执行未授权操作。攻击者无需身份认证即可发起攻击，但需要诱使用户点击恶意链接或访问特制页面。该漏洞影响所有使用该插件的WordPress站点，CVSS评分6.1，危害等级中危。BestWebSoft已在0.1.5版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18590"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-27T12:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:09Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress timesheet 插件至 0.1.5 或更高版本。在 WordPress 后台插件页面搜索 \"timesheet\" 并更新，或手动从 WordPress 插件目录下载最新版本覆盖安装。如无法立即更新，可在服务器 WAF 层添加规则过滤常见的 XSS 载荷（如 `<script>`、`onerror` 等事件处理器）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/timesheet/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18590.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18590.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18590.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18590.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-18590.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18590.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2017-18590.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18590-timesheet-7e0f903a-e882-4de9-953a-c377b591004e.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18590.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18590.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18590.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0098","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18580","title":"WordPress shortcodes-ultimate插件 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WordPress Shortcodes Ultimate 插件（版本低于 5.0.1）存在远程代码执行漏洞。该漏洞源于插件在处理 meta、post 或 user 短代码中的 filter 参数时，未对用户输入进行充分过滤和验证（CWE-20），导致未经身份认证的攻击者可通过构造特制的短代码过滤器，在目标服务器上执行任意 PHP 代码。攻击者无需任何权限，仅需通过网络发送恶意请求即可触发，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议用户立即升级至 5.0.1 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18580"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-22T14:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:08Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 插件 Shortcodes Ultimate 升级至 5.0.1 或更高版本（当前最新版为 7.8.4），在 WordPress 后台「插件」页面找到该插件并点击「更新」，或通过 wp-admin/update-core.php 执行批量更新。如无法立即升级，可暂时停用该插件，并检查网站中是否存在通过 meta/post/user shortcode 传入恶意 filter 参数的攻击痕迹。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/shortcodes-ultimate/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18580.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18580.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18580.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18580.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-18580.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18580.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2017-18580.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18580.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18580-shortcodes_ultimate-e703d411-d608-43cc-8806-1d1e837cf797.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18580.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18580.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0094","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18562","title":"WordPress error-log-viewer插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Error Log Viewer 插件（由 BestWebSoft 开发）1.0.6 版本之前存在多处跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件在 bws_panel 管理页面的 category 参数中未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义，导致已认证的攻击者可以构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL，诱使具有管理员权限的用户点击后，在目标浏览器中执行任意脚本代码，从而窃取会话 Cookie、伪造页面内容或执行其他恶意操作。攻击者需要先获取 WordPress 站点的低权限账号，且需要受害者主动交互（点击链接），攻击复杂度较低。该漏洞影响范围较广，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。厂商已在 1.0.6 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18562"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-22T00:00:00Z","updated":"2019-08-22T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即更新 WordPress error-log-viewer 插件至官方最新版本。如无更新版本或无法升级，在 WordPress 后台禁用该插件，同时配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截包含恶意脚本的请求参数，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18562.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18562.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18562.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18562.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18562.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18562.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2017-18562.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18562.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18562-error_log_viewer-ce4fd12c-824c-44b9-a5be-d2f1abf79acc.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18562.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18562.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0079","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18516","title":"WordPress bws-linkedin插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 bws-linkedin 插件（版本低于 1.0.5）存在多处跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件对用户输入数据缺乏充分的过滤与转义处理，攻击者可通过向受影响页面注入恶意 JavaScript 脚本，当管理员或其他用户访问特制链接时，脚本在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或恶意操作。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接），影响使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18516"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-21T19:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:01Z","remediation":"将 WordPress 的 bws-linkedin 插件升级至 1.0.5 或更高版本。登录 WordPress 后台 → 插件 → 已安装插件 → 找到 bws-linkedin → 点击「更新」；或通过 FTP 删除旧版本后上传最新版。如无法立即更新，可暂时停用该插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/bws-linkedin/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18516.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18516.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18516.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18516.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18516.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18516.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2017-18516.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18516-bws_linkedin-3db65e14-50c6-4afe-84e5-0785fe9bf77a.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18516.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18516.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18516.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0095","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18564","title":"WordPress sender插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Sender 插件 1.2.1 之前版本存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该插件未能正确过滤用户输入数据，导致攻击者可在页面中注入恶意 JavaScript 脚本。攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求将恶意载荷提交至受影响页面，当管理员或其他用户访问时触发脚本执行，造成敏感信息泄露（如会话令牌、Cookie 等）。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户交互（如点击链接），影响数据的机密性和完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18564"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-21T18:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:06Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress Sender 插件升级至 1.2.1 或更高版本（当前最新版 1.4.1），在 WordPress 后台「插件」页面找到 Sender 点击更新即可。如无法升级，可暂时停用该插件，并启用 WordPress 内置的 wp_kses 对用户输入进行 HTML 过滤作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/sender/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18564.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18564.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18564.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18564.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18564.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18564.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18564-sender-de957e90-5758-46f3-90f8-521b47d247ff.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2017-18564.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18564.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18564.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18564.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0096","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18565","title":"WordPress updater插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Updater 插件（由 BestWebSoft 开发）1.35 版本之前存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件在 admin.php 页面的 bws_panel 功能中，对 category 参数未进行充分的输入过滤与转义处理。已登录认证的攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 脚本的特制 URL，诱使具有管理员权限的用户点击，导致恶意脚本在受害者浏览器中执行，从而窃取会话 Cookie、执行未授权操作或篡改页面内容。攻击者需具备 WordPress 站点的最低级订阅者权限，且需要用户交互触发，影响范围涉及所有使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18565"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-21T13:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:06Z","remediation":"将 WordPress updater 插件升级至 1.35 或更高版本。在 WordPress 后台插件管理页面检查并更新 updater 插件至最新版；如已停用该插件，建议彻底删除后重新安装最新版本。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面对包含恶意脚本参数的 URL 请求进行过滤拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/updater/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18565.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18565.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18565.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18565.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18565.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18565.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18565-updater-83157b37-75f6-4ab9-8759-3d9a9cb9303d.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder2/CVE-2017-18565.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18565.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18565.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18565_4.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0093","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18558","title":"WordPress bws-testimonials插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress bws-testimonials 插件（版本 0.1.9 之前）存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件对用户输入的数据未进行充分的过滤与转义处理，攻击者可通过向受影响页面提交特制的恶意脚本载荷，当管理员或其他用户访问包含恶意内容的页面时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露（如会话令牌、Cookie 等）或页面内容篡改。攻击者无需身份认证即可发起攻击，但需要用户交互（如点击链接），影响范围涉及 WordPress 站点中使用了该插件的环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18558"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-21T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:05Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress bws-testimonials 插件至 0.1.9 或更高版本。在 WordPress 后台仪表盘 → 插件 → 已安装插件中找到 bws-testimonials，点击「更新」按钮完成升级。如无法更新，可暂时停用该插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/bws-testimonials/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18558.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18558.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18558.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18558.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18558.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18558.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2017-18558.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18558.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18558-bws_testimonials-ba426d2f-aa05-4316-86ca-228f21785f63.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18558.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18558.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0092","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18557","title":"WordPress bws-google-maps插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress bws-google-maps 插件（版本 1.3.6 之前）存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该插件未能正确过滤用户输入，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响站点发送特制请求，诱使用户点击恶意链接，在用户浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，导致敏感信息泄露或页面内容篡改。攻击需用户交互，影响机密性和完整性，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18557"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-21T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:05Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 插件 bws-google-maps 升级至 1.3.6 或更高版本。登录 WordPress 后台 → 插件 → 已安装插件 → 找到 bws-google-maps → 点击「更新」。如已删除该插件，请彻底卸载并清理残留文件，避免被重新激活利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/bws-google-maps/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18557.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18557.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18557.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18557.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18557.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18557.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2017-18557.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18557.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18557-bws_google_maps-419df0c4-1e78-47da-b28d-5ab1cb66729a.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18557.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18557.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0091","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18556","title":"WordPress bws-google-analytics插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 BestWebSoft Google Analytics 插件（bws-google-analytics）1.7.1 之前版本的后台管理页面中存在跨站脚本漏洞（CWE-79）。该漏洞源于插件在渲染 `bws_panel` 页面时，未对 `category` GET 参数进行充分的输入过滤与输出转义处理，导致攻击者可注入任意 HTML 和 JavaScript 代码。已认证的攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL，诱使具有管理员权限的用户点击，从而在目标浏览器中执行恶意脚本，窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或执行其他恶意操作。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。建议升级至 1.7.1 或更高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18556"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-21T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 bws-google-analytics 插件至 1.7.1 或更高版本：登录 WordPress 后台 → 插件 → 已安装插件 → 找到 BWS Google Analytics → 点击「更新」。如该插件已停更，建议停用并删除，替换为其他活跃维护的 Google Analytics 集成插件（如 Site Kit by Google）。临时缓解：启用 WordPress 内置的 Web 应用防火墙（如 Wordfence）对 XSS 攻击向量进行拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/bws-google-analytics/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18556.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18556.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18556.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18556.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18556.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18556.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2017-18556.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18556.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18556.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18556.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18556-bws_google_analytics-f9900533-0724-445f-9d56-8a0422479448.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0089","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18537","title":"WordPress visitors-online 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress visitors-online插件在1.0.0之前版本存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞（CWE-79）。该插件用于在WordPress网站上展示访客统计信息，但在处理用户输入时未进行充分的过滤、转义和验证，导致恶意JavaScript代码可被注入到生成的网页中。攻击者无需认证，通过网络发起低复杂度攻击，但需要用户交互——即诱使受害者点击包含恶意构造参数的链接。当用户访问被注入脚本的页面时，恶意代码在受害者的浏览器上下文中执行，可导致会话凭证窃取（Cookie劫持）、页面内容篡改、重定向至恶意网站或执行未经授权的操作。该漏洞影响所有安装了visitors-online插件1.0.0之前版本的WordPress站点，CVSS v3评分为6.1（中危）。开发者已在1.0.0版本中修复此问题，建议用户立即升级插件版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18537"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-21T12:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:03Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress visitors-online 插件升级至 1.0.0 或更高版本（当前最新为 1.1.6），该版本已修复多个跨站脚本漏洞。可通过 WordPress 后台「插件」页面点击「Visitors Online」插件的「更新」按钮完成升级，或手动从 WordPress.org 下载最新版覆盖 /wp-content/plugins/visitors-online/ 目录。若暂时无法升级，建议禁用并删除该插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/visitors-online/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18537.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18537.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18537.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18537.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18537.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18537.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2017-18537.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18537.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18537-visitors_online-9032d416-28d1-4fdc-ac95-ba807df165a2.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18537.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18537.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],